cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vailá, please cite the software and the preprint below."
title: "vailá: Versatile Anarcho Integrated Liberation Ánalysis in Multimodal Toolbox"
type: software
version: 0.4.14
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/vaila-multimodaltoolbox/vaila"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python toolbox for multimodal biomechanics: video preprocessing and
  synchronization, markerless 2D pose estimation, DLT calibration and 3D reconstruction,
  C3D/CSV export, and analysis of motion capture, IMU, force plate, EMG and GNSS data,
  with matching graphical and command-line interfaces.
keywords:
  - biomechanics
  - motion analysis
  - markerless motion capture
  - direct linear transformation
  - multimodal data
  - open-source software
